      "side": 1,
      "message": "(This comment is conflicted with the below comment in `cc/bp2build.go`.\n\nShouldn\u0027t the test look like either\n\n```\nmakeBazelTarget(\"cc_library_shared\", \"foo_shared\", AttrNameToString{\n  \"srcs_c\": `[\"foo.c\"]`,\n  \"suffix\": `\"-suf\"`\n})\n```\nif we\u0027re using suffix attribute.\n\nor\n\n```\nmakeBazelTarget(\"cc_library_shared\", \"foo_shared-suf\", AttrNameToString{\n  \"srcs_c\": `[\"foo.c\"]`,\n})\n```\nif we\u0027re not using suffix attribute. If we\u0027re not using suffix attribute, we do need to define it in `staticOrSharedAttributes` and also also the bazel macro.\n\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/build/bazel/+/1999871/8/rules/cc/cc_library_shared.bzl#36",
